note
note src/dual/rx_dual.om -- pure seeded OM-2 DUAL constraint pricing library
note (DUAL-0a, DUAL-0b, DUAL-1a, DUAL-1b; ADR 0031 / ARCH-0031).
note Replaces src/dual/{rx_dual,rx_dual_bind,rx_dual_update,rx_dual_replay}.{c,h}.
note Bounded, deterministic, zero allocation, zero I/O, zero authority.

